ALCOHOL SERVER TRAINING PROGRAM AT BLUE RAVEN BREWERY
•
All employees and owners will be trained using the online (available at Official TIPS Alcohol
Certification Site
I eTIPS
I GETTIPS.com) or in-person version of the TIPS training program.
•
All certificates for training will be maintained as a hard copy as well as in our electronic database
•
We will track training dates and certification expirations using our web-based database tools,
and any employee within 3 months of expiration will be routinely reminded to refresh their
training and provide a new certificate.
•
Any employee that allows their certification to expire will no longer be allowed to serve and will
not be scheduled to work until their training is refreshed.
•
If there are any questions about our proposed alcohol serving training program, please contact
